{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_A1C67290","title":"What'd She Say","entry":"Dlg_A1C67290::entry","exit":"Dlg_A1C67290::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_0BA0AC39","articyId":"72057778721534085","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"What did you do?!","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What did you do?!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":75.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45864","byteOffset":31683312,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_DE14B883","articyId":"72057778721534114","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"I don't think grieving a dead sibling exactly equates to crazy. People process loss differently.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't think grieving a dead sibling exactly equates to crazy. People process loss differently.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":675.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35091","byteOffset":25636288,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_01C4640E","articyId":"72057778721534135","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"How does people dealing with things they're handed go against scripture? If anything, the ones and zeros help us process what's happening.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How does people dealing with things they're handed go against scripture? If anything, the ones and zeros help us process what's happening.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1275.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33909","byteOffset":20710944,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_DA0B6ECF","articyId":"72057778721534156","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"Listen, thank you for checking on her. I... appreciate the gesture, but I think I'll take it from here.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Listen, thank you for checking on her. I... appreciate the gesture, but I think I'll take it from here.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41602","byteOffset":30067032,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_033678FD","articyId":"72057778721534164","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"No... but the Binary God determines... Processing is part of the code that's programmed into each and every one of us.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No... but the Binary God determines... Processing is part of the code that's programmed into each and every one of us.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1862.0,"y":1200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17936","byteOffset":14673808,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_1E5FEEA8","articyId":"72057778721534187","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"I... I need to get back to the church. Thank you for checking on my friend. I hope you find whatever it is you're looking for. Even more so, I hope you're more understanding of those who already have.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I... I need to get back to the church. Thank you for checking on my friend. I hope you find whatever it is you're looking for. Even more so, I hope you're more understanding of those who already have.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":1425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25122","byteOffset":17386192,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_2CCA96BC","articyId":"72057778721534214","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"While I know there are gray areas in the world, I also know it's the ones and zeros that code order out of madness. That truth is enough for me to move forward.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"While I know there are gray areas in the world, I also know it's the ones and zeros that code order out of madness. That truth is enough for me to move forward.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39968","byteOffset":29449688,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_D3DD3DD6","articyId":"72057778721534224","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"I asked you to check on a friend and you do this?","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I asked you to check on a friend and you do this?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":675.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25316","byteOffset":17462224,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_F52245E8","articyId":"72057778721534247","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Magz Zunica","text":"You were supposed to check and comfort not check and insult! I have three snarky holo memes about 'the company I keep'.","speakerId":"Ntt_9CFB5A90","textSource":"localization","pronounTe